---
// Hero.astro
---
<section class="relative pt-12 pb-14 md:pt-20 md:pb-20 overflow-hidden text-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Top badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200/90 text-xs sm:text-sm text-indigo-700 font-semibold mb-8 shadow-xs">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
      </span>
      <span>2026 最新收录与实测推荐 · 全链路晚高峰网络抗封锁验证</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">
      高速稳定 <span class="gradient-text">机场clash</span> 推荐测评导航
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed font-normal">
      严选高性价比稳定机场与企业级 <strong class="text-indigo-600 font-semibold">IPLC / IEPL 跨境内网专线</strong>。晚高峰 4K/8K 极速秒开、不限速不卡顿；全节点原生解锁 Netflix、Disney+ 与 ChatGPT / Claude。提供全平台 Clash 客户端下载与新手进阶图文教程。
    </p>

    <!-- Call to actions -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 mb-14">
      <a
        href="/recommendations"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-indigo-600 to-indigo-500 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-indigo-600 text-white font-bold text-base shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25 hover:shadow-indigo-500/40 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-2"
      >
        <span>⚡ 查看 2026 机场精选推荐</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/tutorials"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-bold text-base shadow-sm hover:text-slate-900 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-2"
      >
        <span>📖 Clash 新手保姆级教程</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/comparison"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/90 text-slate-600 font-semibold text-base transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
        <span>参数横向对比</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature counters -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-left">
      <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-indigo-600 tracking-tight">100%</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mt-1">真实节点测速验证</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">晚高峰真实多线程验证</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-blue-600 tracking-tight">8K 秒开</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mt-1">晚高峰大冗余带宽</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">单节点峰值达 2.5Gbps</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-600 tracking-tight">IPLC 专线</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mt-1">不经GFW · 敏感期稳</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">跨境纯内网光纤直连</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-amber-500 tracking-tight">独家优惠</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mt-1">专属大额立减折扣码</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">官方直通折上折特权</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
